## Machine-Specific Config

### Git
```bash
# Local git config (not shared)
git config user.email "{{LOCAL_GIT_EMAIL}}"
git config user.name "{{LOCAL_GIT_NAME}}"
```

### SSH / GPG
```bash
# SSH key for this machine
export SSH_KEY_PATH="{{SSH_KEY_PATH}}"

# GPG signing key
export GPG_KEY="{{GPG_KEY_ID}}"
```

## IDE / Editor Settings

```json
// VS Code settings.json (local)
{
  "editor.formatOnSave": true,
  "editor.codeActionsOnSave": {
    "source.fixAll": "explicit"
  },
  "files.exclude": {
    "**/.git": true,
    "**/node_modules": true,
    "**/__pycache__": true
  }
}
```

## Local Database / Services

```bash
# Local PostgreSQL
export DATABASE_URL="postgresql://{{DB_USER}}:{{DB_PASS}}@localhost:5432/{{DB_NAME}}"

# Local Redis
export REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379/0"

# Local Elasticsearch
export ELASTICSEARCH_URL="http://localhost:9200"
```

## API Keys (Local Only)

```bash
# NEVER commit these - use .env.local or password manager
export OPENAI_API_KEY="{{OPENAI_API_KEY}}"
export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="{{ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}}"
export GITHUB_TOKEN="{{GITHUB_TOKEN}}"
export AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID="{{AWS_KEY}}"
export AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY="{{AWS_SECRET}}"
```

## Local Testing

```bash
